    "description": "This dataset contains medical records of 299 patients diagnosed with heart failure, collected during their follow-up period. Each patient profile includes 13 clinical features such as serum creatinine levels and ejection fraction, which are key indicators used in predicting patient outcomes. The data supports various machine learning tasks including classification, regression, and clustering to analyze and predict survival chances of heart failure patients. The dataset is valuable for developing predictive models aimed at improving clinical decision-making and patient care.",
